WEBVTT

00:16.599 --> 00:17.600
You doing all right?

00:18.351 --> 00:19.436
Huh?

00:19.519 --> 00:22.063
Not bad, I guess.

00:24.649 --> 00:25.734
By the way,

00:26.860 --> 00:28.403
what happened back then?

00:29.863 --> 00:30.697
What?

00:33.158 --> 00:34.576
You said your mom passed away.

00:41.332 --> 00:42.959
Someone broke into our house.

00:45.587 --> 00:48.840
Everyone in my family was killed
except me.

00:51.885 --> 00:53.386
If my brother were still alive…

00:58.141 --> 01:00.060
he'd probably be about your age.

01:05.815 --> 01:07.650
Ever thought about getting revenge?

01:11.237 --> 01:13.490
You could've found him if you wanted.

01:13.990 --> 01:16.326
Why didn't you just find him
and go "bang"?

01:17.494 --> 01:18.620
Shoot him dead?

01:19.329 --> 01:20.163
Forget it.

01:24.084 --> 01:26.795
So you're saying
you're better than me now?

01:26.878 --> 01:27.837
Is that it?

01:28.338 --> 01:31.257
Him being brought to justice by the law
was enough for you?

01:31.341 --> 01:32.509
Because you're a cop?

01:36.346 --> 01:38.890
People don't change that easily.

01:40.517 --> 01:42.936
The bastards who ripped out my eye

01:43.019 --> 01:44.771
would've ripped out someone else's,

01:45.313 --> 01:47.398
even if it hadn't been mine.

01:47.482 --> 01:49.484
If taking revenge ruins my life…

01:51.653 --> 01:52.695
is it worth it?

02:13.925 --> 02:15.343
It was all so sudden.

02:16.344 --> 02:18.012
I still can't believe it.

02:52.213 --> 02:53.882
Jake reached out to us.

02:54.632 --> 02:55.466
Why?

02:55.967 --> 03:00.471
It seems some people interested
in Korea's situation want to reach out.

03:02.140 --> 03:04.517
Tell him I'll decide
after I meet them myself.

03:04.601 --> 03:06.853
And he was quite worried.

03:07.812 --> 03:08.688
About me?

03:09.189 --> 03:10.690
Or the business?

03:22.327 --> 03:23.453
REPORTER WANG DAE-HYEON

03:23.536 --> 03:25.496
I THINK THERE'S SOMETHING YOU SHOULD KNOW

03:25.580 --> 03:26.497
LEE DO IS AWAKE

03:34.631 --> 03:35.882
Thank you for coming.

03:38.718 --> 03:39.886
Years ago,

03:40.637 --> 03:44.557
Do and I were on a mission
in a conflict zone in the Middle East.

03:47.518 --> 03:50.021
Everyone there was armed,
kids and adults alike,

03:50.104 --> 03:52.690
and weapons were piled high
in the streets.

03:52.774 --> 03:56.152
I wondered, "What if guns
became this available in Korea?"

03:57.195 --> 04:00.907
At the time, I thought something like that
could never happen in Korea.

04:02.909 --> 04:05.828
So? How's the gun retrieval going?

04:05.912 --> 04:09.624
Once the investigation shifted
after the shootings by Yu and Jeon,

04:10.124 --> 04:12.168
they began using real couriers.

04:12.669 --> 04:16.089
They seem to have a strong grasp
of the Korean people and the system.

04:16.589 --> 04:18.174
We estimate about 10,000 guns

04:18.258 --> 04:20.760
have been distributed
in the past few days.

04:21.469 --> 04:27.225
It probably hit harder because the footage
of you getting shot aired right before.

04:27.308 --> 04:29.602
Seems like fearmongering
really did the trick.

04:30.270 --> 04:33.690
"If you don't want to end up like that,
pick up a gun."

04:34.691 --> 04:36.109
That's the greatest fear

04:37.151 --> 04:38.653
a gun holds.

04:38.736 --> 04:39.862
That's right.

04:40.613 --> 04:44.117
"Now I have to protect myself
with the gun in my hands."

04:44.659 --> 04:46.369
That's probably what they thought.

04:53.001 --> 04:55.128
Sir, I think you should see this.

04:57.171 --> 04:59.090
A GATHERING OF SUPPORTERS
OF GUN OWNERSHIP LEGALIZATION

04:59.173 --> 05:01.551
This has just begun circulating
on social media.

05:01.634 --> 05:03.928
It already has 300,000 views from shares.

05:08.016 --> 05:08.850
Yes, Director.

05:08.933 --> 05:12.145
The president is preparing a statement.
He may declare martial law.

05:12.228 --> 05:15.898
If he does, Korea will become
a country ruled by guns once again.

05:16.482 --> 05:17.859
Attention, everybody.

05:17.942 --> 05:20.945
Check who's available
and deploy them right away.

05:21.029 --> 05:23.656
We need to quickly identify
who's organizing this rally.

05:23.740 --> 05:26.034
If it becomes a large rally,
anything could happen.

05:26.117 --> 05:27.118
Understood.

05:34.292 --> 05:35.501
Huh?

05:36.711 --> 05:37.712
What is it?

05:39.380 --> 05:40.590
Look at this.

05:41.215 --> 05:42.383
What is this?

05:45.094 --> 05:46.888
A pro-gun ownership rally?

05:46.971 --> 05:49.307
A GATHERING OF SUPPORTERS
OF GUN OWNERSHIP LEGALIZATION

05:49.390 --> 05:52.769
A gathering at a time like this
can only lead to disaster.

05:56.814 --> 06:01.486
In light of unprecedented mass shootings
and untraceable firearm distribution,

06:01.569 --> 06:04.906
some argue that gun ownership
should be allowed in Korea.

06:05.490 --> 06:09.994
Pro-gun protesters have gathered
to express their views to the government.

06:10.078 --> 06:10.912
No guns!

06:10.995 --> 06:13.039
Fears of a major clash have risen

06:13.122 --> 06:16.584
as anti-gun protesters hold
a counterrally.

06:17.418 --> 06:19.670
Have any of you ever been shot?

06:19.754 --> 06:23.925
I nearly died
because of some crazy bastard.

06:24.008 --> 06:26.219
We've been living perfectly fine
without guns!

06:26.302 --> 06:30.139
With so many guns out there,
who knows what could happen next?

06:30.223 --> 06:33.935
We need to think about our families
and our future!

06:34.018 --> 06:35.978
No guns. Never!

06:36.062 --> 06:42.151
- Never!
- Legalize guns!

06:51.744 --> 06:52.829
Hi, Mom.

06:52.912 --> 06:54.914
So-hyeon. Are you still at the hospital?

06:55.415 --> 06:56.249
Yeah.

06:56.749 --> 06:58.668
I'm on night shifts all week.

06:58.751 --> 06:59.585
I see.

06:59.669 --> 07:01.212
And you're doing okay?

07:01.295 --> 07:02.839
Why wouldn't I be?

07:03.339 --> 07:06.134
I heard a lot of people
have been shot lately.

07:06.217 --> 07:08.219
Your hospital must be chaotic as well.

07:08.302 --> 07:10.930
Mom, I gotta get back to work.
Talk to you later.

07:11.013 --> 07:12.390
Sure. Take care.

07:40.126 --> 07:41.127
Officer Jang.

07:41.752 --> 07:43.963
I think I need to go to that rally.

07:47.258 --> 07:48.384
I'll make sure

07:49.469 --> 07:51.804
the captain gets the farewell he deserves.

07:54.557 --> 07:55.641
Thank you.

08:10.364 --> 08:14.035
You! Didn't I say I wouldn't take it
if you talked back again?

08:14.827 --> 08:15.953
I'm sorry.

08:17.622 --> 08:21.209
You really think you're in a position
to question your shifts?

08:21.292 --> 08:23.461
Just take the shifts you're given.

08:23.544 --> 08:24.962
You're right. I'm sorry.

08:31.344 --> 08:32.178
Look.

08:32.929 --> 08:34.764
One word to the head nurse from us

08:35.473 --> 08:38.309
and your career's done and dusted.

08:38.935 --> 08:41.062
Think twice before you act up.

08:45.316 --> 08:46.984
If she acts up again, let me know.

08:47.068 --> 08:48.361
She's so annoying.

08:48.444 --> 08:50.488
Today's snack is dakbal!

08:50.571 --> 08:52.114
Same place as last time?

08:52.198 --> 08:54.283
Of course. You don't even have to ask.

08:54.367 --> 08:56.827
Ma'am, you're the best.

09:35.116 --> 09:36.867
Legalizing gun ownership…

09:36.951 --> 09:37.952
NO GUNS!

09:38.035 --> 09:40.580
…could make bulletproof vests as necessary

09:40.663 --> 09:44.125
as masks were during the pandemic.

09:44.208 --> 09:46.460
We want guns!

09:46.544 --> 09:49.714
Legalize it!

09:49.797 --> 09:52.091
Is that really the world
we want to live in?

09:52.174 --> 09:54.260
No guns!

09:54.969 --> 09:57.346
Pro-gun legalization protesters
have exceeded 10,000,

09:57.430 --> 10:00.558
surpassing police estimates,
with numbers still rising.

10:00.641 --> 10:02.893
As police prepare for all contingencies,

10:02.977 --> 10:05.771
they're also working
to identify those behind the protest.

10:05.855 --> 10:09.025
…fully mobilized police
over a potential large-scale clash…

10:09.108 --> 10:13.362
Police suspect Blue Brown
organized protesters via social media.

10:13.446 --> 10:16.532
They are searching
for the group's base of operations

10:16.616 --> 10:18.868
but have reportedly found no major leads.

10:26.500 --> 10:28.628
NO CALLER ID

11:29.563 --> 11:31.315
Did you enjoy your tour of hell?

11:35.444 --> 11:36.654
Why me, of all people?

11:41.158 --> 11:42.284
At first,

11:43.494 --> 11:44.328
just curiosity?

11:45.955 --> 11:46.997
I really had

11:47.081 --> 11:49.500
high expectations

11:49.583 --> 11:51.711
for that gosiwon guy.

11:51.794 --> 11:53.587
It's not mandatory per se,

11:53.671 --> 11:56.590
but rules are made
for everyone to follow, so--

11:56.674 --> 11:59.635
Hey, why the hell do you care?

11:59.719 --> 12:01.011
I'm fine.

12:01.095 --> 12:02.263
People are looking.

12:08.060 --> 12:10.896
But then a police officer
showed up out of nowhere

12:12.398 --> 12:13.691
and stopped him.

12:14.233 --> 12:17.945
So I did some digging into that officer…

12:18.028 --> 12:18.988
CONFIDENTIAL
TOP SECRET

12:19.071 --> 12:22.658
…and it turns out he shot
countless people dead in the past.

12:23.659 --> 12:26.078
Now he says he'll never pick one up again.

12:26.662 --> 12:27.496
Funny, isn't it?

12:29.582 --> 12:32.126
Is that face of yours real?

12:33.419 --> 12:34.587
Or is it all fake?

12:35.921 --> 12:38.090
That's when
something interesting struck me.

12:40.801 --> 12:42.845
"If you picked up a gun again,

12:43.804 --> 12:45.306
how would it change you?"

12:47.391 --> 12:48.976
Why did it have to be me?

12:49.059 --> 12:50.936
We have a few things in common.

12:51.562 --> 12:53.731
A rough childhood,

12:54.982 --> 12:56.609
an obsession with revenge,

12:57.902 --> 13:00.237
and the choice to pick up a gun for it.

13:00.738 --> 13:04.366
Don't justify your actions
like there's some philosophy behind them.

13:06.452 --> 13:09.330
You're nothing more
than a third-rate peddler who profits…

13:11.415 --> 13:12.792
by inciting fear.

13:17.797 --> 13:20.549
What difference does it make to me now

13:21.050 --> 13:23.093
if I sell one more gun?

13:24.136 --> 13:25.554
I'm simply curious

13:26.347 --> 13:28.933
what would happen

13:29.683 --> 13:33.103
if guns became widely available
in this country.

13:36.982 --> 13:39.360
There were far more people

13:39.443 --> 13:41.987
who wanted guns than I expected.

13:44.615 --> 13:47.701
In the end, a gun was the only way

13:48.285 --> 13:53.207
they could release
their pent-up resentment and frustration.

13:59.213 --> 14:00.840
I don't need anything right now.

14:02.633 --> 14:05.219
Excuse me.
It's been bothering me for a while.

14:06.554 --> 14:10.099
That was also true for the captain,
who had been like a father to you.

14:14.436 --> 14:16.021
And the same for Kyeong-suk.

14:22.403 --> 14:23.654
In the end, it was a gun…

14:24.363 --> 14:25.573
Thank you.

14:26.407 --> 14:27.741
…that saved them.

14:37.918 --> 14:41.005
In a world
where the strong devour the weak,

14:42.339 --> 14:46.510
it's not your cheap sympathy
that will protect them.

14:47.011 --> 14:50.764
The answer is a gun
that lets them enforce their own justice.

14:52.224 --> 14:56.061
That's why I want to live
in a utopia of equality

14:57.479 --> 14:59.315
where everyone owns a gun.

14:59.398 --> 15:00.608
That's all I want.

15:01.150 --> 15:01.984
No.

15:02.818 --> 15:04.445
There's no such utopia.

15:06.739 --> 15:09.033
That is nothing but a hell…

15:11.327 --> 15:12.870
where people kill and get killed.

15:16.582 --> 15:17.583
What a shame.

15:23.422 --> 15:24.882
I thought you, of all people…

15:27.801 --> 15:29.470
would understand me.

15:31.680 --> 15:32.681
Then,

15:33.599 --> 15:34.892
shall we see

15:35.935 --> 15:37.019
who's right?

16:05.756 --> 16:06.799
What are you doing?

16:12.388 --> 16:15.099
I'll show you the world I want to see.

16:16.183 --> 16:17.810
Just sit back and watch.

16:55.222 --> 16:57.224
- What's with that truck?
- What's going on?

17:09.737 --> 17:13.073
The guns are right in front of you.
What are you waiting for?

17:13.991 --> 17:15.367
Hurry up and take them.

17:16.493 --> 17:17.327
They're guns!

17:17.411 --> 17:18.412
They are guns!

17:25.044 --> 17:26.628
Guns! Hurry!

17:42.352 --> 17:44.938
Guns are being distributed
from the truck in the square.

17:45.022 --> 17:46.523
Civilians are swarming in.

18:19.181 --> 18:21.100
You motherfucker!

18:22.684 --> 18:24.186
Request SOU reinforcements.

18:24.269 --> 18:25.104
Yes, sir.

18:52.798 --> 18:53.757
Breaking news.

18:53.841 --> 18:56.385
A sudden, large-scale distribution
of firearms occurred

18:56.468 --> 18:58.929
at today's pro-gun ownership rally.

18:59.513 --> 19:04.726
As citizens scrambled and collided,
the rally quickly descended into chaos.

19:04.810 --> 19:07.271
Police have cordoned off the area

19:07.354 --> 19:09.857
due to concerns
about a possible shooting at the square

19:09.940 --> 19:14.361
and have pledged to confiscate
all guns distributed at the scene.

19:14.444 --> 19:17.614
We will provide further updates
as things develop.

20:05.162 --> 20:08.248
Get it all on camera.
Don't miss a single moment.

20:08.332 --> 20:09.333
Yes, sir.

20:15.464 --> 20:16.298
Move!

20:21.053 --> 20:22.304
Give me that!

20:25.224 --> 20:28.602
What else can we do when shootings happen
almost every other day?

20:28.685 --> 20:30.646
Put the gun down, or I'll shoot.

20:30.729 --> 20:34.024
I just want to protect my family
since the government won't.

20:34.107 --> 20:35.692
Is that wrong?

20:36.526 --> 20:38.320
- No. You can't.
- Why not?

20:38.403 --> 20:40.656
I was minding my own business
and almost got shot!

20:40.739 --> 20:42.741
Fuck it! I don't want to die, so I'm--

20:42.824 --> 20:45.535
Let go! Get your hands off me!

20:52.709 --> 20:55.420
FIREARMS DISTRIBUTED AT RALLY
SCENE IN PANIC

21:09.977 --> 21:12.562
FIREARMS DISTRIBUTED AT RALLY
SCENE IN PANIC

21:16.316 --> 21:20.988
UNEXPECTED FIREARM DISTRIBUTION
SPARKS CHAOS AT RALLY

21:57.316 --> 21:58.567
You see that, Lee Do?

22:00.610 --> 22:01.445
If, as you say,

22:02.321 --> 22:04.990
a world where everyone carries a gun
is truly hell,

22:06.992 --> 22:09.786
then why do so many people want one?

22:12.080 --> 22:14.166
What could possibly

22:15.375 --> 22:17.544
make them pick up a gun?

23:19.106 --> 23:20.273
It was this world

23:21.525 --> 23:23.902
that made the people angry.

23:26.488 --> 23:27.614
All I did

23:28.490 --> 23:30.075
was hand them a gun.

23:32.702 --> 23:34.413
It's up to them

23:35.038 --> 23:37.499
whether they pull the trigger.

23:53.223 --> 23:54.057
Lee Do.

23:58.228 --> 24:00.564
If a gunshot went off right here and now,

24:01.356 --> 24:03.275
what would happen to these people?

24:04.443 --> 24:05.861
Is this what you wanted?

24:09.448 --> 24:10.532
No.

24:11.741 --> 24:12.951
What I want…

24:14.995 --> 24:16.455
is a single gunshot.

24:26.214 --> 24:27.382
A single gunshot

24:27.466 --> 24:30.343
that will make these people

24:31.845 --> 24:33.555
start shooting at each other.

24:41.104 --> 24:45.358
Wouldn't pulling a 5-millimeter trigger
in pursuit of revenge

24:46.818 --> 24:48.778
spread fear in the minds of many?

24:49.362 --> 24:52.073
Out of fear
that they might die without a gun,

24:53.116 --> 24:54.993
everyone will rush to get one.

24:56.536 --> 24:57.913
And a society like that

24:58.830 --> 25:00.207
will soon be destroyed.

25:57.556 --> 25:58.932
Don't shoot!

26:23.290 --> 26:25.250
Don't come any closer!

26:25.333 --> 26:26.751
Move!

26:34.718 --> 26:35.802
Mom!

27:14.215 --> 27:16.217
Help me, please!

27:23.058 --> 27:24.934
Mommy.

27:32.692 --> 27:33.693
It's okay.

27:36.613 --> 27:37.864
You're safe.

28:03.765 --> 28:08.395
HARU DAILY

28:31.418 --> 28:34.337
GUN DISTRIBUTION SPARKS
ESCALATING VIOLENCE AT RALLY

28:39.884 --> 28:43.722
Tragically, there has been
yet another incident.

28:44.222 --> 28:48.309
The mass shooting at Gyeongin Stadium

28:48.393 --> 28:52.689
has reportedly left
over 70 casualties so far.

28:53.231 --> 28:55.608
The death toll is expected to rise

28:55.692 --> 28:58.778
as many remain in critical condition.

28:59.988 --> 29:02.741
During the mass shooting
at Gyeongin Stadium,

29:02.824 --> 29:06.202
a citizen's brave act
of saving an elementary school child

29:06.286 --> 29:08.079
brought a heartwarming moment.

29:08.580 --> 29:13.585
The citizen risked his life to protect
the child in a dangerous situation.

29:13.668 --> 29:17.338
Even amid ongoing gunfire,
he kept the child safe until the very end.

30:09.641 --> 30:16.648
WE WILL REMEMBER THE INNOCENT LIVES LOST
AND WORK TO CREATE A SAFER WORLD

30:16.731 --> 30:20.735
MAY THE VICTIMS REST IN PEACE

30:26.783 --> 30:28.326
ANTI-GUN PETITION

30:28.409 --> 30:29.994
We are collecting signatures.

30:30.662 --> 30:31.955
Hello, please sign here.

30:32.038 --> 30:33.498
Yes, you can sign here.

30:33.581 --> 30:34.749
ILLEGAL FIREARM DROP-OFF POINT

30:34.833 --> 30:35.917
Thank you.

30:38.586 --> 30:39.504
All good.

30:39.587 --> 30:40.755
Thank you.

30:47.887 --> 30:49.722
- One handgun, right?
- Yes.

30:50.974 --> 30:52.350
It took too long.

30:56.271 --> 30:57.605
You did the right thing.

31:01.943 --> 31:02.861
Sign here, please.

31:07.574 --> 31:09.784
PARK SO-HYEON, FEMALE

31:12.245 --> 31:13.246
Have a good day.

31:21.629 --> 31:22.881
Hey, man.

31:23.631 --> 31:25.008
Wow.

31:25.091 --> 31:27.552
The view from here is amazing.

31:28.928 --> 31:30.847
I'll be using this room. Yeah.

31:32.599 --> 31:33.433
What?

31:33.516 --> 31:36.436
Why would you censor my article?

31:37.770 --> 31:39.689
Victim protection, my ass.

31:41.232 --> 31:45.778
Touch my article without asking,
and I'm switching to another network.

31:54.370 --> 31:55.622
Holy shit. What the hell?

31:55.705 --> 32:00.835
Do you have any idea what your article did
to my innocent child's life?

32:01.753 --> 32:04.464
I begged and pleaded with you
to take it down.

32:04.547 --> 32:05.673
Hold on a second.

32:05.757 --> 32:07.425
I wrote the article, so--

32:36.913 --> 32:39.958
With severe blood loss
and widespread cancer,

32:41.000 --> 32:43.461
chances of recovery are low.

34:01.748 --> 34:02.582
Okay.

39:31.994 --> 39:36.999
Subtitle translation by: Sung In Jang
